	<span>
		Performance
	</span>
</h2>
<p>To comprehensively evaluate our proposed method, we construct the SkyReels-Bench for human assessment and leveraged the open-source <a href="https://github.com/Vchitect/VBench" rel="nofollow">V-Bench</a> for automated evaluation. This allows us to compare our model with the state-of-the-art (SOTA) baselines, including both open-source and proprietary models.</p>
